{"4633330": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Whitewasher", "steam_appid": 4633330, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You are a Whitewasher</strong>, a cleaner hired to do the dirty work nobody talks about. Every shift, suspicious boxes arrive via the elevator. Your job: retrieve them, figure out how to open them safely, destroy the evidence inside, and ask no questions. <strong>But the boxes have a way of making you ask questions anyway.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4633330/extras/f281b857e24434fdf29d0a0a977e23b6.poster.avif?t=1781182714\" width=1170 height=802 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4633330/extras/f281b857e24434fdf29d0a0a977e23b6.webm?t=1781182714\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4633330/extras/f281b857e24434fdf29d0a0a977e23b6.mp4?t=1781182714\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Get Boxes &amp; Open Them</strong> Each box that arrives is locked, labeled, and potentially dangerous. Examine the markings, study the lock mechanism, and determine the correct procedure to open it without triggering hidden hazards. One wrong move and you could damage the contents, or yourself.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4633330/extras/19f89a6b6289a4870f97fd937384b73c.poster.avif?t=1781182714\" aria-label=\"Destroy Evidence\" width=1170 height=770 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4633330/extras/19f89a6b6289a4870f97fd937384b73c.webm?t=1781182714\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4633330/extras/19f89a6b6289a4870f97fd937384b73c.mp4?t=1781182714\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Operate different destruction machines by following specific procedures; adjust settings and avoid mistakes that can damage equipment or lose valuable materials.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Piece together the story by inspecting the contents of each package, discovering hidden clues, and deciding whether to follow orders or question them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzle-based box examination and unlocking system with unique hazard conditions per box</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple destruction machines, each with distinct operating rules and failure states</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A narrative mystery told entirely through the evidence you're meant to destroy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Moral choices: comply with orders or investigate the conspiracy</p></li></ul></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You are a Whitewasher</strong>, a cleaner hired to do the dirty work nobody talks about. Every shift, suspicious boxes arrive via the elevator. Your job: retrieve them, figure out how to open them safely, destroy the evidence inside, and ask no questions. <strong>But the boxes have a way of making you ask questions anyway.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4633330/extras/f281b857e24434fdf29d0a0a977e23b6.poster.avif?t=1781182714\" width=1170 height=802 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4633330/extras/f281b857e24434fdf29d0a0a977e23b6.webm?t=1781182714\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4633330/extras/f281b857e24434fdf29d0a0a977e23b6.mp4?t=1781182714\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Get Boxes &amp; Open Them</strong> Each box that arrives is locked, labeled, and potentially dangerous. Examine the markings, study the lock mechanism, and determine the correct procedure to open it without triggering hidden hazards. One wrong move and you could damage the contents, or yourself.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4633330/extras/19f89a6b6289a4870f97fd937384b73c.poster.avif?t=1781182714\" aria-label=\"Destroy Evidence\" width=1170 height=770 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4633330/extras/19f89a6b6289a4870f97fd937384b73c.webm?t=1781182714\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4633330/extras/19f89a6b6289a4870f97fd937384b73c.mp4?t=1781182714\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Operate different destruction machines by following specific procedures; adjust settings and avoid mistakes that can damage equipment or lose valuable materials.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Piece together the story by inspecting the contents of each package, discovering hidden clues, and deciding whether to follow orders or question them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzle-based box examination and unlocking system with unique hazard conditions per box</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple destruction machines, each with distinct operating rules and failure states</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A narrative mystery told entirely through the evidence you're meant to destroy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Moral choices: comply with orders or investigate the conspiracy</p></li></ul></li></ul>", "short_description": "You don't ask where the evidence comes from. You just decide what disappears. Inspect packages, destroy bloody materials with machines, or return clean ones. A dark management game in a corrupt pharmaceutical giant's basement, until the wrong package makes you question everything.", "supported_languages": "English, Turkish", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4633330/adaac42516f573aac5ecf974abb549fd71eec178/header.jpg?t=1781182714", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4633330/b41913df39c55c4ae97c2a168f028b0d8bf19b94/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1781182714", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4633330/b41913df39c55c4ae97c2a168f028b0d8bf19b94/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1781182714", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10, Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong>  Intel Core i5-7400 CPU, AMD Ryzen 3 1200<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GTX 1050, AMD RX560<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 15 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> 64 bit processor and operating system is advised.</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb